ined for $x\\in Q,$ is always true. $\\,\\times $\n\n- Predicate II, defined for $x\\in Q,$ is *not* always false. $\\,\\times $\n\n- Predicate III, defined for $x\\in Q,$ is always false. $\\,✓$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"III only.\""}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186384712 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186157233 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "45f828cb-c8b1-5da4-9711-15ace712dffa" :knowledge-point/title "Completing Vacuous Statement"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8f0ca0d6-1e31-5f52-a9f3-a2ca22f3ca3b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II and III only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186384714} {:answer/id #uuid "254dbc5b-2bbb-58db-8cbf-3962404beb1d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186384715} {:answer/id #uuid "f580a84e-5584-5962-9e4d-62ddcd12124c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "III only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186384716} {:answer/id #uuid "b47cb603-e332-5679-8442-02c8dddcc850" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I and II only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186384717} {:answer/id #uuid "9489682f-80e4-5e22-8a86-25c2d844a1ef" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186384718}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9489682f-80e4-5e22-8a86-25c2d844a1ef" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186384718} :answer-field/id #uuid "dc88d937-ca83-5ad3-b9be-ce6288fc6d2e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186384713}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "a08b61